# VACASK: SFFM defaults, $abstime, chgtol, the save caveat (062bcac0, part f).
# What the fix was for, as the ledger has it: `B1 (b 0) v=v(in)*$abstime`, clean report.
from: ngspice
to: vacask
--- input
t
V1 in 0 1
B1 b 0 V={v(in)*time}
.end
--- output
t
ground 0
model vsource vsource
V1 (in 0) vsource dc=1
B1 (b 0) v=v(in)*$abstime
--- report
warning[caveat]: line 3: bsource.name: VACASK (b2c1551) names the module it synthesizes after the instance but looks it up in lower case, so an instance name with capitals is not found
